WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:36.000
Morning triage: the agent reads unread counts and channel history, then writes one prioritized briefing.

00:36.000 --> 01:07.000
Workspace search: the agent digs a printer admin PIN out of a five-month-old #facilities post.

01:07.000 --> 01:32.000
Decision recall: what was decided about the Postgres 17 migration, answered from #engineering history.

01:32.000 --> 02:31.000
Write paths: the agent reads the incident thread for context, then posts a tagged, threaded update.

02:31.000 --> 02:58.000
Closing loops: a reaction lands on the resolution message and #incidents is marked as read.

02:58.000 --> 03:24.000
Export: the last 24 hours with threads saved for the post-mortem — ending the morning at 0 unreads.
